he tiny hole (was: sprawled across the pie). Thin ring 0.08 + percent labels: 9px-floor labels straddle the thin ring. Both are extreme-knob choices; template stays honest.\n\n**Primitive-sense: KEEP primitive:true** \u2014 the canonical ring-chart primitive (self-framed coarse-quantize, RATIO at any canvas; light mode composable).\n\nBattery 84/84 \u00d72 (baseline + final build), contract probe 14/14 defaults + 84/84 binding configs (incl. Cyrillic, thick 0.9, thin 0.08), jest 16/16.",
